  (text "USB-C device port (USB 2.0 only, UFP)\nCC1/CC2: 5.1k pulldowns. VBUS is sense-only, never a supply input.\nD-/D+ 90R differential pair, length-matched in layout; 22R series at MCU side.\nShield: 1M || 4.7nF to GND (no hard tie). D21 clamps USB_VBUS_SENSE to AVCC/AGND.\nUSB_VBUS_SENSE feeds TMUX1204 S4 (sensing sheet)."
    (at 100.33 106.68 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "f6cfce4d-f9d6-430d-8443-566c7110d913"))

